  "comments": "Die <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - small script of circular legend, in the coat of arms in sinister chief plenty of small dots in background, &quot;50&quot; large, &quot;0&quot; narrow.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - large script of circular legend, in the coat of arms in sinister chief 13 large dots in background, &quot;50&quot; small, &quot;0&quot; wide.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/625c1a4755eb8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/625c1a4755eb8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 2000, 2001.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 2002, 2004.<br /><br />\r\nExamples by years.<br /><br />\r\n2000 - Little dots in the circle around the letters. Big coat of arms. Big 50 with narrow zero.<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a803814a5829.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a803814a5829.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2001 - Big dots in the circle around the letters. Big coat of arms. Big 50 with narrow zero.<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a80384087cc8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a80384087cc8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n2004 - Little dots in the circle around the letters. Little coat of arms. Little 50 with wide zero.<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a803867dc03c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a803867dc03c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"150\" /></a>",
